th of the month.\"}, {\"text\": \"The 18th is a hard cut-off, not a target.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"The 18th is a hard cut-off, not a target.\"}, {\"text\": \"Submissions that arrive after the cut-off are held for the following month's run.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"Submissions that arrive after it are held for the following month's run.\"}, {\"text\": \"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it.\"}, {\"text\": \"Team leads submit one file per team.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"Submit one file per team\"}, {\"text\": \"The submitted file lists every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to\"}, {\"text\": \"Blank rows are rejected by the upload page.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"Blank rows are rejected by the upload page.\"}, {\"text\": \"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\"}, {\"text\": \"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request\"}, {\"text\": \"Corrections submitted after the cut-off are applied to the following month.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"are applied to the following month\"}, {\"text\": \"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, team leads should email the payroll team and keep the file.\", \"line\": 21, \"span\": \"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the payroll team and keep the file.\"}, {\"text\": \"Team leads should not send totals in the body of an email.\", \"line\": 21, \"span\": \"Do not send totals in the body of an email.\"}, {\"text\": \"Teams without terminal access may send paper timesheets to the payroll office by internal post.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"Teams without terminal access may send paper timesheets to the payroll office by internal post\"}, {\"text\": \"Paper timesheets sent by internal post must arrive no later than the cut-off.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"to arrive no later than the cut-off\"}]}","ttft_ms":7184,"type":"result","duration_ms":7219,"uuid":"26b2cb14-f68e-4897-99d3-a2a838342633","ttft_stream_ms":1220,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":1221,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
